<title>UK: Natl Grid ups stake in Argentina's Citelec.</title>
<headline>Natl Grid ups stake in Argentina's Citelec.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Britain's National Grid Group Plc said on Tuesday it had received final Argentine government approval to raise its stake in Citelec SA to 41.25 percent from 15 percent.</p>
<p>National Grid expected to pay nearly $50 million to increase its stake in the company, which controls Transener SA, the owner of Argentina's main electricity transmission system.</p>
</text>
